# Package only what a consumer builds. The source fixtures in testdata/ are not
# built, so they stay out of the published archive. The generated constants in
# internal/fixtures/ ship, because the root test imports them and moon resolves
# test imports when it builds the archived module. So the source list and the
# license notices of the vendored data ship too. scripts/check-framework-registry.mbtx
# checks the archive. (moon.mod `include` and `exclude` are deprecated.)
/testdata/**
!/testdata/**/
!/testdata/README.md
!/testdata/conformance/LICENSE
!/testdata/conformance/NOTICE
!/testdata/wycheproof/LICENSE
